---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ReviewBanner from '../../components/ReviewBanner.astro';
import Tbc from '../../components/Tbc.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---
<Base title="Security and confidentiality" description="How remote legal support teams work within your firm's systems, access controls and supervision.">
  <ReviewBanner slot="banner" note="List only measures Aldred confirms are in place (SEC-1); legal review of supervision and confidentiality wording needed (COMP-6)." />
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Security and confidentiality</div>
      <h1>Your systems. Your rules. Your oversight.</h1>
      <p>Your firm decides which systems and information our team can access, and keeps responsibility for supervising the work.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>Your firm stays in control</h2>
      <ul role="list">
        <li>Your firm chooses the systems, accounts and permissions the team uses, and can change or remove access at any time.</li>
        <li>Your supervising attorney directs substantive work and reviews it before it is relied on.</li>
        <li>Working practices, communication and escalation routes are agreed in writing before work begins.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Our safeguards</h2>
      <p><Tbc what="the security and confidentiality measures actually in place (for example confidentiality agreements, device and access controls, training)" /></p>
      <h2>Questions to discuss with us</h2>
      <p>Every firm’s obligations and systems are different. In your consultation we can talk through:</p>
      <ul role="list">
        <li>Where and how the team works, and which devices they use</li>
        <li>How access is granted, reviewed and removed</li>
        <li>Confidentiality commitments from {site.brand} and each team member</li>
        <li>How work is assigned, reviewed and approved by your attorneys</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Your firm remains responsible for its own professional obligations. We do not claim that using our service makes a firm compliant with any rule.</p>
      <p><a href="/contact/">Request a consultation</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
